flowchart TD
  HTML[当前 HTML 内容与版本] --> MIME[过滤非 JavaScript script MIME]
  MIME --> Native[保留原生 submit/reset/summary 与 HTML 路径]
  MIME --> AST[Acorn 有界只读 AST 解析]
  AST --> Proof[按具体控件证明 lookup/helper/alias/委托绑定]
  AST --> Limits[动态或跨脚本变更/解析失败/预算限制]
  Proof --> Bound[bound：仅语法绑定，不证明行为正确]
  Proof --> Absent[完整可判范围无绑定：unbound]
  Limits --> Unknown[unknown：明确 warning，不声称无实现]
  Absent --> Block[真实缺入口继续 blocking]
  Native --> Report[新静态报告 slash-quality-4]
  Bound --> Report
  Unknown --> Report
  Block --> Report
  Report --> Browser[原严格浏览器与内容审查继续]
  History[旧版本 static evidence] --> Stale[只在读取副本标 stale/unverified]
  Stale --> Preserve[历史原件不改，不自动重跑]
